# Line endings are normalized to LF in the repository.
# R4.54: the whole working tree had been rewritten to CRLF while the index held
# LF, so every file reported as modified and no revision could be committed
# without dragging a whole-file line-ending rewrite into it. This file makes the
# normalization explicit instead of depending on each machine core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf
